description:
They just feel different--

if you nurture the shit experience you'll feel shittier,

if you nurture the positive experience you'll feel more energised,

if you feel like you kind of WANT to nurture the shit experience,

that's probably the root problem that perpetuates low motivation and procrastination.

Why do you want to nurture the shit experience? 

figuring that out will probably help you change a LOT
